00:22:20,562 --> 00:22:43,910
所以当计算共轭 Q^{-1} P Q 并且用轮换形式表示时，事情非常简单：你只需取出原来的轮换，把里面的每一个整数都替换为该整数在 Q 下的像。
So when you form the conjugate Q^{-1} P Q and you're working in cycle shape, it's very easy: what you do, you just take the original cycles and replace every integer here with Q of that integer.

80
00:22:43,910 --> 00:23:03,376
如果这还不够显然，让我稍微仔细地解释一下为什么这是对的。关键在于下面这个公式：假设 i 在 P 下映到j。
So let me—okay, so that's not obvious, let me explain slightly more carefully why that's true. So the key point is the following formula: suppose i is sent by P to j.

