But it also doesn't—but it's also true that 3 4 is the same as 1 2—I mean I could also write this as 3 4 1 2, I could put the 3 4 here in the 1 2 here, so it doesn't matter what order those two are in, so I divide by another 2, then you're left with 1, so that's 15.

