So it's very like this formula I wrote down here: if you try to write a formula, you write it as a product of cycles, basically have a 5 factorial to begin with, which is the ways you can choose these things, and then you've got to divide by any ambiguity.

152
00:47:01,963 --> 00:47:21,980
每当有一个 r-轮换，你就除以 r，因为可以在内部任意循环排列；每当有一对长度相同的轮换，就除以 2；如果有三个相同长度的轮换，就除以 3!；四个相同长度的轮换就除以4!，因为次序无关紧要。
So whenever you have an r-cycle, you divide by r because you can write them in any order; and whenever you have a pair of cycles the same length, you divide by another 2; or if you had three cycles the same length, you divide by 3 factorial; or four cycles the same length, you divide by a 4 factorial, because it didn't matter what.

